# Keep LF in the repository and in every checkout, whatever core.autocrlf says. These packages are
# served byte-for-byte (the DSH client half is loaded as-is by the page) and diffed across platforms,
# so a CRLF checkout would change what runs and turn every diff into noise.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be normalised.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
